---
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 border-b border-zinc-800">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-8">
    <div class="lg:col-span-4 lg:sticky lg:top-24 h-fit">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-100 mb-4">Metodologia e<br/>Visione Tecnica</h2>
      <p class="text-zinc-500 mb-6 font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">[ Approccio Ingegneristico ]</p>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
        Il codice è l'artefatto finale di un processo di analisi. Mi concentro sull'estrazione dei requisiti di dominio e sulla corretta modellazione concettuale prima dell'implementazione.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="lg:col-span-8">
      <div class="space-y-0">
        <!-- Item 1 -->
        <div class="border-t border-zinc-800 py-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
          <div class="md:col-span-1">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Fase 01</span>
          </div>
          <div class="md:col-span-3">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-200 mb-3">Analisi Funzionale e Requisiti</h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Traduzione degli obiettivi di business in specifiche formali. Utilizzo standard consolidati per prevenire ambiguità e definire i confini del sistema.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-zinc-800/50 text-zinc-400 font-mono text-xs border border-zinc-700/50">UML Use Cases</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-zinc-800/50 text-zinc-400 font-mono text-xs border border-zinc-700/50">BPMN 2.0</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-zinc-800/50 text-zinc-400 font-mono text-xs border border-zinc-700/50">System Specs</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 2 -->
        <div class="border-t border-zinc-800 py-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
          <div class="md:col-span-1">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Fase 02</span>
          </div>
          <div class="md:col-span-3">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-200 mb-3">Modellazione Dati e Relazionale</h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Il dato guida l'architettura. Progettazione di schemi logico-relazionali enforcing constraints a livello di database per garantire l'integrità.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-zinc-800/50 text-zinc-400 font-mono text-xs border border-zinc-700/50">ER Diagrams</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-zinc-800/50 text-zinc-400 font-mono text-xs border border-zinc-700/50">Normalizzazione (3NF)</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-zinc-800/50 text-zinc-400 font-mono text-xs border border-zinc-700/50">SQL Constraints</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 3 -->
        <div class="border-t border-zinc-800 py-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
          <div class="md:col-span-1">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Fase 03</span>
          </div>
          <div class="md:col-span-3">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-200 mb-3">Architettura Software</h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Implementazione di logiche di business isolate dalla presentazione, seguendo paradigmi object-oriented e separation of concerns.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-zinc-800/50 text-zinc-400 font-mono text-xs border border-zinc-700/50">MVC Pattern</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-zinc-800/50 text-zinc-400 font-mono text-xs border border-zinc-700/50">SOLID Principles</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-zinc-800/50 text-zinc-400 font-mono text-xs border border-zinc-700/50">REST APIs</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 4 -->
        <div class="border-t border-zinc-800 border-b py-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
          <div class="md:col-span-1">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Fase 04</span>
          </div>
          <div class="md:col-span-3">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-200 mb-3">Integrazione Pipeline AI</h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Leverage di Large Language Models (LLM) per accelerare la redazione tecnica, la generazione di boilerplate e la code review statica.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-zinc-800/50 text-zinc-400 font-mono text-xs border border-zinc-700/50">Prompt Engineering</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-zinc-800/50 text-zinc-400 font-mono text-xs border border-zinc-700/50">Workflow Automation</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
